{"unit_id":"jiangzhenguo__dsh-codegraph#card-zh","repo":"jiangzhenguo/dsh-codegraph","commit":"647ae4d5bb8b483ff7820c0714042d4ca9b21f80","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH CodeGraph（DSH 插件，支持 DSH Web、TUI、桌面与 CLI 客户端）：把 CodeGraph 的预索引代码知识图谱接入 DSH agent。插件注册原生工具，并可在系统提示词中引导优先使用图谱；默认提供状态、初始化、增量同步和区域探索，切换 full 后可搜索符号、读取节点或文件、查看调用关系、评估改动影响及受影响测试。可对单一项目操作，也支持包含已索引成员仓库的符号链接工作区。适合需要理解大型代码库结构、追踪调用链或规划重构的开发者。需要安装 codegraph CLI 并将其放入 PATH；查询前项目需有索引，未初始化时可用工具创建。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:100-104","lib/index.js:377-385","lib/index.js:714-895"]}
{"unit_id":"jiangzhenguo__dsh-codegraph#card-en","repo":"jiangzhenguo/dsh-codegraph","commit":"647ae4d5bb8b483ff7820c0714042d4ca9b21f80","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH CodeGraph connects DSH agents to CodeGraph indexes. Native tools check, build, sync, and explore indexes; full mode adds symbol lookup, call relations, and impact analysis. It supports indexed projects and symlink workspaces. Install the codegraph CLI and initialize each project before querying.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:100-104","lib/index.js:377-385","lib/index.js:714-895"]}
